cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cat-list – Category → List"
abstract: >-
  A Wikimedia Toolforge tool that takes a category on any Wikimedia wiki and lists
  its pages, following subcategories to a chosen depth, with each page's Wikidata
  item, parent categories, and Wikidata labels, descriptions and instance of (P31).
  Results export as CSV, TSV, JSON, wikitext or a QID list.
